nodes.body:
@clawsweeper re-review

Addressed the wire-boundary finding in 70e02b1deffc52f241443710d84e97d6073127a5. The test now verifies the attempted unsubscribe carries authority, inspects physical stdin frames for zero unsubscribe writes and no successor start, and retains unchanged binding/assignment assertions. All nine rotation tests pass; independent P2 review is clean. Production is unchanged by the two CI fixture commits.

The other CI failure is independently present on main after #164199: the terminal-observer test helper lacks readSanitizedResult. Scheduled main run 37113342869, job 111175455568, reports the same four cases. The failing mock and consumer blobs match the tested main and PR merge. Broader Testbox validation and paired baseline proof remain in progress before native landing.
